    "# Purpose",
    "",
    "The **Payments API** takes card payments for Acme Journals. Team Hermes owns it.",
    "",
    "\u003e **Info**",
    "\u003e",
    "\u003e The API is part of the Billing system.",
    "",
    "## Endpoints",
    "",
    "| Endpoint | Method | Use |",
    "|---|---|---|",
    "| /payments | POST | Take a payment |",
    "| /payments/{id}/refund | POST | Refund a _settled_ payment |",
    "",
    "## Dependencies",
    "",
    "- The Payments API depends on the Ledger service.",
    "- It calls the Fraud check API for each payment.",
    "  - The call times out after 2 seconds.",
    "",
    "```json",
    "{\"amount\": 1200, \"currency\": \"EUR\"}",
    "```",
    "",
    "See Payments API runbook for incidents."
  ]
}
